       "id": "40307251"
      }
     ],
     "value": "Part of the SCF (SKP1-CUL1-F-box) E3 ubiquitin-protein ligase complex SCF(FBXO32) formed of CUL1, SKP1, RBX1 and FBXO32. Interacts with cyclin D1/CCND1 (PubMed:40307251)"
    }
